Package: dtschema-check-cpufreq-log
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: dt_binding_check result for the MT6797 cpufreq-series DT bindings
 Runs, at build time, dt_binding_check over the three DT schema files the
 MT6797 cpufreq series touches (mediatek,mt6797-mcumixed, mediatek,cci,
 mediatek,mt6797-cpu-sram) and fails the build if the checker reports any
 issue. The captured checker log is shipped in this package.
